senses.gloss:
(I)--a friend of राम. Dvivida was one of his ministers. Helped राम in his expedition to लन्का. Held the chauri when Bharata carried the पादुका. Attained salvation by satsanga;
1: भा. IX. १०. १६, १९ & ४३; X. ६७. 2; XI. १२. 6.
the son of Viraja and सूर्य: रुमा was his queen: younger brother of वालि;
2: Br. III. 7. २१५, २२० & ७०.
present at राम's अभिषेक;
3: Vi. IV. 4. १००.
to be worshipped before commencing the construc- tion of a palace.
4: M. २६८. १५
